ct":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,84,44,41,27,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1019705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10040","city":"CS1052","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,84,44,41,27,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1019705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国大将，初随孙策，被其形容面黄睛赤，形容古怪，进攻刘繇部队时斩杀其麾下大将张英，孙权继位后随其转战各地，多为先锋出阵。刘备欲携孙尚香奔赴荆州之时前去阻拦，但被孙尚香所呵斥。濡须口之战时与庞德大战，不分上下，但因其袖袍被树枝所挂住而失利被杀。战后被陆逊寻得尸首后运回建邺，与董袭一同被厚葬。","tc":"吳國大將，初隨孫策，被其形容面黃睛赤，形容古怪，進攻劉繇部隊時斬殺其麾下大將張英，孫權繼位后隨其轉戰各地，多為先鋒出陣。劉備欲攜孫尚香奔赴荊州之時前去阻攔，但被孫尚香所呵斥。濡須口之戰時與龐德大戰，不分上下，但因其袖袍被樹枝所掛住而失利被殺。戰后被陸遜尋得尸首后運回建鄴，與董襲一同被厚葬。","en":"A senior general of Wu who initially served Sun Ce, who described him as having a sallow face and red eyes with an unusual bearing. In the offensive against Liu Yao's forces, he slew the enemy general Zhang Ying. After Sun Quan succeeded to power, he accompanied him across numerous campaigns, frequently spearheading the vanguard. When Liu Bei attempted to take Sun Shangxiang to Jing Province, he moved to intercept them, but was rebuked by Sun Shangxiang. During the Battle of Ruxukou, he fought fiercely with Pang De to a stalemate, but was slain after his sleeve caught on a tree branch. Following the battle, Lu Xun recovered his body and brought it back to Jianye, where he was buried with great honor alongside Dong Xi.","jp":"呉の大将。初め孫策に従い、「面黄睛赤、形容古怪（黄色い顔に赤い目、異様な風貌）」と評された。劉繇軍を攻めた際にはその配下の大将である張英を討ち取った。孫権が跡を継ぐと各地を転戦し、多く先鋒として出陣した。劉備が孫尚香を連れて荊州へ赴こうとした際にこれを阻もうとしたが、孫尚香に一喝された。濡須口の戦いでは龐徳と激闘を演じて互角に渡り合ったが、袖が木の枝に引っかかった隙を突かれて討ち取られた。戦後、陸遜によって遺体が収容されて建業へと運ばれ、董襲とともに手厚く葬られた。","kr":"오나라의 대장. 처음에 손책을 따랐는데, 낯빛이 누렇고 눈이 붉어 생김새가 기괴하다는 평을 받았다. 유요의 군대를 공격할 당시 휘하 대장 장영을 베었으며, 손권이 뒤를 이은 후에도 각지를 전전하며 주로 선봉으로 출진했다. 유비가 손상향을 데리고 형주로 달아나려 할 때 앞을 가로막으려 했으나, 오히려 손상향에게 호통을 들었다. 유수구 전투에서 방덕과 격전을 벌여 우열을 가리지 못했으나, 소매가 나뭇가지에 걸리는 바람에 패하여 전사했다. 전투가 끝난 뒤 육손이 시신을 수습하여 건업으로 운구했고, 동습과 함께 후하게 장사 지내졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10190","remark":"","surname":"陈","surnameTc":"陳","surnameEn":"Chen","surnameJp":"陳","surnameKr":"진","surnameOther":"","name":"武","nameTc":"武","nameEn":"Wu","nameJp":"武","nameKr":"무","nameOther":"","word":"子烈","wordTc":"子烈","wordEn":"Zilie","wordJp":"子烈","wordKr":"자열","wordOther":"","icon":"陈武","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"195","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"84","wise":"44","politics":"41","charm":"27","will":"71","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"12","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"86/35/35/35/35/14/50/35","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1005400;1002500","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1011505","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5100","battleSoulPoint":"7000","debateSoulPoint":"1900","strategy":"1002701;1008415","strategy2":"1003101","professions":"4/3/0/0/0/4/2/0/0/0/2/4/3/0/1/0/0/0/0/1/0/5/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"82","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3100","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"176","show":"195","death":"215","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"2","weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1019705","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;3/1;19/1;33/1;39/1;10/1;30/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"WJ10671/100","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0